		'What AI, machine learning, deep learning and generative AI really mean, with everyday examples and no maths.',
		'<h3>1. AI is pattern-finding, not magic</h3><p>Artificial intelligence is software that learns patterns from examples instead of following rules a programmer wrote by hand. Show a program 10,000 photos labelled “cat” or “dog” and it learns what separates them. That is <strong>machine learning</strong>.</p><h3>2. The family tree</h3><ul><li><strong>AI</strong>: the whole field of machines doing tasks that need intelligence.</li><li><strong>Machine learning</strong>: AI that learns from data (spam filters, price prediction).</li><li><strong>Deep learning</strong>: machine learning with large neural networks (face unlock, speech-to-text).</li><li><strong>Generative AI</strong>: deep learning that creates new text, images, audio or code (ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Midjourney).</li></ul><h3>3. How a chatbot answers you</h3><p>A large language model (LLM) read a huge amount of text and learned to predict the next word. When you ask a question, it writes the most likely helpful continuation, one small piece (a <em>token</em>) at a time. It does not look things up unless the app gives it a search tool.</p><h3>4. What AI is great at</h3><ul><li>Drafting: emails, posts, summaries, outlines.</li><li>Explaining: “explain recursion like I’m 12”.</li><li>Transforming: translate, reformat a table, fix grammar, convert code.</li><li>Brainstorming: 20 ideas in 10 seconds, then you pick.</li></ul><h3>5. Where it fails</h3><ul><li>It can state wrong facts confidently (“hallucination”). Check names, numbers, dates and laws.</li><li>Its knowledge stops at a training date unless it can browse.</li><li>It copies biases in its data. Review anything about people.</li></ul><h3>6. Your first 3 habits</h3><ol><li>Give context: who you are, who it is for, what format you want.</li><li>Ask for steps or options, not just one answer.</li><li>Verify anything important with a trusted source.</li></ol><p><strong>Next:</strong> read “How ChatGPT-style models work”, then try 5 prompts from the Prompt 