		'Real freelance and job-side services built on AI tools, what clients pay for, a starter price range and how to get the first client.',
		'<h3>Rule one</h3><p>Clients do not pay for “AI”. They pay for a result: more leads, saved hours, a better website. AI just lets you deliver it faster.</p><h3>12 services</h3><ol><li><strong>Website in a week</strong> with AI-assisted code and copy (small shops, clinics, coaching classes).</li><li><strong>Chatbot on a website</strong> answering FAQs from the client’s documents (RAG).</li><li><strong>Social media content packs</strong>: 30 posts + 8 reels scripts a month.</li><li><strong>Product photos and banners</strong> with image models plus real editing.</li><li><strong>Resume and LinkedIn makeovers</strong> for freshers.</li><li><strong>Data cleaning and dashboards</strong> from messy Excel files.</li><li><strong>Automation</strong>: forms → sheets → WhatsApp/email follow-ups.</li><li><strong>Translation and localisation</strong> (English ↔ Hindi and regional languages), human-checked.</li><li><strong>YouTube support</strong>: scripts, titles, thumbnails, chapters.</li><li><strong>Prompt and workflow training</strong> for small teams.</li><li><strong>Code review and test writing</strong> for startups.</li><li><strong>Motion sections and landing pages</strong> (see Motion Studio).</li></ol><h3>Pricing starter guide</h3><ul><li>Price by package, not by hour: “5-page website: ₹12,000–25,000”, “Content pack: ₹8,000/month”.</li><li>International clients usually pay 3–5× more. Start on one platform, collect 5 reviews, then raise prices.</li><li>Always charge 30–50% upfront.</li></ul><h3>First client in 14 days</h3><ol><li>Pick ONE service and ONE type of client.</li><li>Build 3 sample projects (free for friends or made-up brands).</li><li>Send 10 personalised messages a day showing a quick improvement you made for them.</li><li>Deliver early, ask for a testimonial, ask for a referral.</li></ol><h3>Stay honest</h3><p>Tell clients you use AI tools and that a human reviews everything. Never sell fake reviews, fake followers or deepfakes of real people.</p>'
